WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.411
The dusty stranger bowed to Rat.

2
00:00:04.412 --> 00:00:07.381
Then he smiled and sat down.

3
00:00:07.382 --> 00:00:10.153
Rat sat down too.

4
00:00:10.154 --> 00:00:13.996
The stranger took a deep breath.

5
00:00:13.997 --> 00:00:17.672
"I smell clover and smoke on the wind.

6
00:00:17.673 --> 00:00:23.037
A river runs close by here," he said, sniffing.

7
00:00:23.038 --> 00:00:26.188
"You have a good life, my friend."

8
00:00:26.189 --> 00:00:28.905
"Yes," said Rat proudly.

9
00:00:28.906 --> 00:00:32.018
"The riverbank is the best!"

10
00:00:32.019 --> 00:00:35.393
The visitor smiled to himself.

11
00:00:35.394 --> 00:00:39.859
"Well, it's not for everyone," he said.

12
00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:42.658
"Where are you from?" asked Rat.

13
00:00:42.659 --> 00:00:47.039
"I am a sea rat," he said.

14
00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:52.483
"I was born in an old city far away."

15
00:00:52.484 --> 00:00:55.635
"A sea rat?" asked Rat.

16
00:00:55.636 --> 00:00:58.197
"Yes," said Sea Rat.

17
00:00:58.198 --> 00:01:01.996
"I know every port in the world."

18
00:01:01.997 --> 00:01:05.618
"You sail on big ships!" said Rat.

19
00:01:05.619 --> 00:01:10.779
Rat loved all boats, big and small.

20
00:01:10.780 --> 00:01:14.866
"Tell me all about it!" said Rat.

21
00:01:14.867 --> 00:01:20.436
"Once I sailed the coast of Italy," said Sea Rat.

22
00:01:20.437 --> 00:01:25.001
"I lived in the captain's cabin."

23
00:01:25.002 --> 00:01:28.556
Sea Rat sighed with pleasure.

24
00:01:28.557 --> 00:01:31.567
"We ate shellfish with wine!

25
00:01:31.568 --> 00:01:35.699
We dined on baked bread and cheese.

26
00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:40.943
On shore, we lay under olive trees."

27
00:01:40.944 --> 00:01:45.651
Rat imagined all the food.

28
00:01:45.652 --> 00:01:48.781
"Now I'm hungry," said Rat.

29
00:01:48.782 --> 00:01:51.180
"Will you have lunch with me?"

30
00:01:51.181 --> 00:01:56.953
"A wonderful idea!" said Sea Rat.

